            "y": 400,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 240,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Polling trigger\n\nToggl has no webhooks. The trigger records where the account stands on its first check and then checks every 5 minutes, so the provoking action runs after a 2-minute Wait (after the first check) and the event can take up to about 7 minutes. Do not remove the Wait."
